  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Forge/Fabric</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>1.16.5 -&gt; 1.21</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組收錄了來自 2023 年生物投票的螃蟹生物。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">關於螃蟹：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-受攻擊時有 25% 機率掉落蟹鉗</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-螃蟹會在 5 到 10 分鐘後再生蟹鉗</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-手持蟹鉗可放置或擊打更遠處的方塊（範圍 +4），並會消耗其耐久度</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-蟹鉗可以烹飪</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-它們可以攀爬方塊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-它們可以出現在紅樹林沼澤生物群系中</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-可用海草誘導與繁殖</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">感謝下載本模組！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=71695030\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/logo/become_a_patron_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"51\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://billing.kinetichosting.net/aff.php?aff=320\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jingames.net/dailymodder.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/898/262/638343732455468022.gif\"></p>",
